  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Just launched on 30A’s west end, Sea Breeze Sanctuary is a brand-new 11BR Gulf-view retreat designed for large groups and elevated stays. Enjoy a private pool, multiple kitchens, game room, and balconies—plus concierge support included with every stay. Early guests receive a special welcome experience. Prime dates available—book now.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Nearly 6,700 square feet of living space across four stories, designed for groups who need room to spread out without sacrificing comfort. Every bedroom has its own ensuite — no shared bathrooms, no waiting. Three full kitchens let you cook for the whole crew or split up meals by floor. The game room keeps everyone entertained between beach trips. The fourth-floor tower is the place to be at sunset.<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guests have full, private access to the entire home and all amenities during their stay. This includes all living areas, kitchens, bedrooms, bathrooms, outdoor spaces, and entertainment areas.<br><br><br><br>You’re welcome to enjoy:<br><br><br><br>-The private pool and outdoor kitchen/bar<br><br>-Multiple indoor living and lounge spaces<br><br>-All fully equipped kitchens<br><br>-Game room and fitness/yoga space<br><br>-Balconies and outdoor seating areas<br><br>-Gated driveway and on-site parking<br><br><br><br>The home is designed for shared enjoyment, and all spaces shown in the listing photos are available for guest use. Any locked owner closets or storage areas are clearly marked and not part of the guest space.<br><br><br><br>If you have questions about the layout or amenities before booking, we’re happy to help so you can plan your stay with confidence.<br><br><br><br>The Neighborhood:<br><br>The West End of 30A is quieter and more residential than the central beach towns, but still just minutes from dining, shopping, and the beach. The property borders Tops'l State Park, providing a natural privacy buffer and access to coastal trails. Local favorites like Stinky's Fish Camp, Three Son's BBQ, and Gulf Place are nearby. Grayton Beach and Seaside are a short drive or bike ride east.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>A car is helpful for groceries and exploring 30A, but the area is very bike and golf-cart friendly. The Timpoochee Trail runs along 30A and connects most beach communities. Parking for 8 vehicles on-site.<br><br><br><br>Other Things to Note:<br><br>Private pool with expanded deck, outdoor kitchen and bar, three full kitchens, game room (ping pong, billiards, arcade), dedicated fitness and yoga space, multiple covered balconies, new flooring throughout, perimeter privacy fencing with gated entry, parking for 8 vehicles.<br><br><br><br>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)<br><br><br><br>How many guests can the home accommodate?<br><br>-The home comfortably sleeps up to 30 guests.<br><br><br><br>Are all bedrooms ensuite?<br><br>-The home has 11 bedrooms and 7 full bathrooms. Some bathrooms are shared between nearby bedrooms. The sleeping arrangements section shows the exact layout.<br><br><br><br>Is this home suitable for events or parties?<br><br>-The home is best suited for family gatherings, retreats, and group getaways. Large events or parties are not permitted.<br><br><br><br>Is the home accessible for guests with mobility concerns?<br><br>-The home spans four levels and requires stair use. There is no elevator.<br><br><br><br>How does concierge support work?<br><br>-Concierge assistance is included with every stay. Guests can reach out via your booking platform messaging for recommendations, planning help, or questions before and during their visit.<br><br><br><br>Is parking available on-site?<br><br>-Yes. The gated driveway accommodates up to 8 vehicles.<br><br><br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br><br>We’re always here if you need us. Guests can reach out at any time through your booking platform messaging for questions, support, or assistance before and during your stay.<br><br><br><br>Every reservation includes concierge support, so whether you’re looking for local recommendations, help planning something special, or have a question about the home, our team is happy to assist. We’re responsive, helpful, and respectful of your privacy — available when you need us and unobtrusive when you don’t.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
